Package: linux-image-@abiname@@localversion@
Meta-Rules-Target: meta
Meta-Rules-Makeflags: INSTALLDOCS_LINK_DOC=linux-base-@abiname@@localversion@
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.linux.nokernel>
Depends:
 linux-base-@abiname@@localversion@ (= ${binary:Version}),
 linux-binary-@abiname@@localversion@ (= ${binary:Version}),
 linux-modules-@abiname@@localversion@ (= ${binary:Version}),
 kmod,
 ${misc:Depends},
Recommends: linux-base (>= 4.5~)
Suggests: firmware-linux-free, linux-doc-@version@
Description: Linux @upstreamversion@ for @class@ with Intel optimizations
 The Linux kernel @upstreamversion@ optimized for Intel platforms, including
 Intel-specific patches and features not yet in mainline. This kernel is
 built for use on @longclass@ with Intel hardware optimizations.
